## 🎯 Agla Padaav: Event Loop aur Callbacks

Yahan par ek bohot bada sawaal uthta hai: **Jab `setTimeout` ka time poora hota hai, toh JavaScript ko kaise pata chalta hai ki ab use chalan hai?** JavaScript ke paas is background data ko manage karne ke liye ek manager hota hai jise hum **Event Loop** kehte hain.
